@startuml Dependencies
title Data Dependencies in Jacobi Algorithm

package "Iteration k" {
  component x0_k as "x[0] (k)"
  component x1_k as "x[1] (k)"
  component x2_k as "x[2] (k)"
  component xn_k as "x[n-1] (k)"
}

package "Iteration k+1" {
  component x0_k1 as "x[0] (k+1)"
  component x1_k1 as "x[1] (k+1)"
  component x2_k1 as "x[2] (k+1)"
  component xn_k1 as "x[n-1] (k+1)"
}

x0_k --> x0_k1 : depends on
x1_k --> x0_k1
x2_k --> x0_k1
xn_k --> x0_k1

x0_k --> x1_k1
x1_k --> x1_k1
x2_k --> x1_k1
xn_k --> x1_k1

x0_k --> x2_k1
x1_k --> x2_k1
x2_k --> x2_k1
xn_k --> x2_k1

x0_k --> xn_k1
x1_k --> xn_k1
x2_k --> xn_k1
xn_k --> xn_k1

note right of x0_k1
  Each new value depends
  on all previous values
  (data parallelism across i)
end note
@enduml